      "comment": "ZIPPING RUFFIAN (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 10 length second (36.31) over 622m at Richmond. Winning claims. TARA REBEL (3) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 5th (23.26) at The Gardens. Likely to be thereabouts. PIZZA THIEF (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at The Gardens in a handy 23.03 beating Hollies Hayley. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Should feature again. MR. NICKO (6) is worth a look despite no experience at this circuit.",
